1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:00,885
Negative.

2
00:00:00,885 --> 00:00:04,348
The column is pulled from above, so it is under tension.

3
00:00:04,348 --> 00:00:13,242
Positive and large is the trap: that describes a turgid living cell whose wall pushes back, or the small push of root pressure at night.

4
00:00:13,242 --> 00:00:17,343
At midday the xylem water is stretched, not squeezed.

